Sval: load Sval's sheet inside Screenshots' overlay

The overlay draws in a shadow root in the page's anonymous content,
which no window or page sheet reaches. One more link after
`overlay.css` puts Sval's `sval-screenshots-overlay.css` in that root.

diff --git a/browser/components/screenshots/ScreenshotsOverlayChild.sys.mjs b/browser/components/screenshots/ScreenshotsOverlayChild.sys.mjs
index a3f628cea0..d6d73b4c85 100644
--- a/browser/components/screenshots/ScreenshotsOverlayChild.sys.mjs
+++ b/browser/components/screenshots/ScreenshotsOverlayChild.sys.mjs
@@ -109,6 +109,7 @@ export class ScreenshotsOverlay {
     return `
       <template>
         <link rel="stylesheet" href="chrome://browser/content/screenshots/overlay/overlay.css" />
+        <link rel="stylesheet" href="chrome://browser/content/sval/sval-screenshots-overlay.css" />
         <div id="screenshots-component">
           <div id="preview-container" hidden>
             <div id="face-container" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="${previewFaceAriaLabel.attributes[0].value}">
